      "extract": "Large Language Models (LLMs) have demonstrated remarkable ca- pabilities across diverse natural language processing tasks. This empowers exciting LLM-integrated applications, which complete the user task with access to external data from the environment. However, this agentic way of using LLMs in systems also introduces novel attack surfaces, among which prompt injection has become a critical security vulnerability",
